                    briefing_text_r1:       `The OCAI profile of 90 staff is in: the unit is heavily <strong>Clan</strong> (collaborate) and <strong>Adhocracy</strong> (create), with little <strong>Market</strong> (compete) or <strong>Hierarchy</strong> (control). The Scale-or-Stall mandate demands a sharp shift toward results, SLAs and standardized process. The trap is to call the culture <em>broken</em> — the same culture produced 98% satisfaction for eleven years, better than any unit in the company. Read it as <strong>imbalanced for the new mandate</strong>, name the two quadrants you must ADD, and name the contradiction out loud rather than pretending it away.`,
                    briefing_title_r2:      `Round 2 — Set the balance: flexibility vs control, internal vs external`,
